  },
  {
    "id": 1023003010030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "わ、カモメいる～！\r\nプロデューサー見た～？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300301/1023003010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……え？\r\nあ……はは、そうだな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003010040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300301/1023003010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003010050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "プロデューサー\r\nなんか元気無い～？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300301/1023003010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ……ああ、いや\r\n違うんだ、そうじゃなくて──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003010060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\nもしかして、また何か心配事～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300301/1023003010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\n心配……って言うのがいいのかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "別に雛菜のことを信じてないわけじゃないぞ？\r\nただ、もうすぐ『G.R.A.D.』の準備も始まるしさ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日から泊りがけの撮影で……\r\n雛菜に負担、かけるんじゃないかと思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003010070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～\r\n別に、雛菜は全部楽しみだけど～",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300301/1023003010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003010080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だって、この番組も『G.R.A.D.』も\r\n出られるの、結構すごいでしょ～？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300301/1023003010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん、すごいことだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それだけ雛菜がこれまで\r\n頑張ってきてくれたってことだし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それに多分、この番組をきっかけに、\r\n雛菜やノクチルのことを知ってくれる人も多いと思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003010090,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～、そっか～\r\nじゃあ、よかったね～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300301/1023003010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003010100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ま、みんながそうして欲しいかは\r\nわかんないけど～",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300301/1023003010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは…………\r\n……そうかもしれないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003010110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でも、雛菜はよかったよ～？\r\nお仕事だけど、修学旅行ってなんか楽しそうだし～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300301/1023003010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003010120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜はあんまり見たことなかったけど\r\nこれ、結構人気の番組でしょ～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300301/1023003010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、『サードシーズン』が作られるくらいだからな\r\nそれだけ前の２作の人気も高かったみたいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003010130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だよね～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300301/1023003010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003010140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "なんかママも前のやつ見てたって言ってたから\r\n色々教えてもらっちゃった！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300301/1023003010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003010150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "『雛菜ちゃんいいな～』だって\r\nママも高校生でアイドルだったらよかったのにね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300301/1023003010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……\r\nよく予習してきてくれたみたいだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
